    <string name="about_made_in">Made in India · Open to the world</string>
    <string name="about_open_source">Open source. Every world included. No ads or subscriptions.</string>
    <string name="about_services">OpenStreetMap with OSRM routes cars; Valhalla routes motorcycles, bicycles and walks. Ferrostar provides navigation guidance, rerouting and remaining ETA. Nearby discovery streams Vela’s Overture, AllThePlaces and OpenStreetMap place archive. Optional Wikimedia Commons photos are off until enabled and shown with source and license credits. Optional Google suggestions, place details and photos use undocumented keyless web endpoints when enabled; Google receives search text and a location bias while you type, then the selected place name and coordinates when you open its details. No Places API key or Places API billing is used. Saved places stay on this phone.</string>
    <string name="about_satellite">Satellite imagery in the Elden Ring, Zelda and Hogwarts maps: Esri, Maxar, Earthstar Geographics, and the GIS User Community. Those maps ask Esri for imagery of the area on screen.</string>
